id: pm-slack-standup-add0
title: "Certify pm CLI 2026.9.21 and move onto the canonical pm-ops merge-driver, lint and duplication gates"
description: "Certify this package against pm CLI 2026.9.21 and replace the vendored merge-driver plus the missing lint and duplication gates with the canonical pm-ops 2026.9.18 launchers. Companion epic pm-cli-website-5s6z. Open issue pm-slack-standup-7t31 still owns exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, mutation, and broader security analyzers; this task delivers only the certify pins and the canonical merge-driver, ESLint, and jscpd gates."
type: Task
status: canceled
priority: 1
tags[4]: certify,multi-agent,pm-cli-2026.9.21,quality
created_at: "2026-09-22T05:10:13.284Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-25T09:02:20.696Z"
author: pi-agent
acceptance_criteria: "package.json and package-lock.json pin @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.21, pm-changelog 2026.9.18, and pm-ops 2026.9.18 exactly; scripts/prepare-merge-driver.ts is a thin launcher over pm-ops/merge-driver, CI installs merge drivers before pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers, and the README names the launcher; lint and duplication are thin pm-ops launchers, wired into release:check and CI, with every finding fixed in code and duplicationGate threshold 0 / minTokens 50; npm run release:check exits 0 and measured coverage does not drop below the recorded baseline"
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-22T05:12:06.672Z",pi-agent,"Baseline before source fixes, measured by importing runLintGate/runDuplicationGate from pm-ops 2026.9.18 with cwd=worktree: lint 42 errors (32 no-restricted-syntax any, 8 eqeqeq, 1 no-promise-executor-return, 1 no-duplicate-imports). duplication 0.99% / 10 clone pairs / 84 of 8471 lines. No open Dependabot PRs. Pins confirmed in package.json and package-lock.json: @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.21, pm-changelog 2026.9.18, pm-ops 2026.9.18, jscpd ^4.3.0 resolved 4.3.0."
  "2026-09-22T19:35:42.768Z",pi-glm-pm-slack-standup,"Lint and duplication gates now pass. Fixed all 33 lint errors (1 no-duplicate-imports, 32 TSAnyKeyword): merged duplicate import in fetch-all-items.test.ts, replaced all (e: any) assert.throws matchers with shared expectCommandError helper in test/test-helpers.ts, replaced all 'as any' block casts with precise SlackContextBlock/SlackHeaderBlock/SlackSectionBlock types, typed smoke.test.ts mock api as ExtensionApi. Fixed 2 pre-existing typecheck errors in index.ts (SlackMrkdwn[] footer elements, SlackPostPayload postToSlack param). Removed all 7 jscpd clone pairs (0.62% → 0%): extracted yesterdayTodayFixture/bucketingItems/teamItems/trendFixture helpers in units.test.ts, setupBothShims helper in fetch-all-items.test.ts, expectCommandError shared across both test files, and made accept-canonical-reader.ts reuse completeListEnvelope from the fixture. npm run lint exit 0, npm run duplication 0%, npm run release:check exit 0 (199 tests pass, coverage 90.42/88.38/91.79 above 83/87/87 thresholds), pm health --strict-exit exit 0."
  "2026-09-25T08:34:19.797Z",fleet-wave-script,Superseded by pm-slack-standup-19up (2026.9.23 certify)
